{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850030/extras/414223ba3b0ed29f36e11ed74341d2a2.avif?t=1753856316\" /></div><i>Omashu: Snail Racing</i> is a tiny (bug-sized!), hand-crafted, time trial async multiplayer racing game about having quick reflexes and grinding for a spot on the leaderboard with a perfect run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850030/extras/e273a05dfe3d60c317bde8b82a4567f6.poster.avif?t=1753856316\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850030/extras/e273a05dfe3d60c317bde8b82a4567f6.webm?t=1753856316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850030/extras/e273a05dfe3d60c317bde8b82a4567f6.mp4?t=1753856316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Online leaderboards and ghosts of other racers allow you to see strategies and pitfalls, allowing you to optimize your run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Short intense bursts of gameplay, you will complete most levels in less than 10 seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-The game has simple to play mechanics, but deep movement tech will be needed to get a top spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-4 biomes and 12 levels in the first version, with more coming soon</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850030?t=1753856316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850030?t=1753856316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850030/9d36fb413f724754273a953a5c12716cfbd9a754/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753856316","